{
  "id": 399596849,
  "iid": 20557,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "kerberos: Add IAKerb error codes to Kerberos asn1 files",
  "description": "IAKerb has added two new error codes:\n\n```c\n#define KRB_AP_ERR_IAKERB_KDC_NOT_FOUND         85 /* The IAKERB proxy could not find a KDC */\n#define KRB_AP_ERR_IAKERB_KDC_NO_RESPONSE       86 /* The KDC did not respond to the IAKERB proxy */\n```\n\n\nSource: [k5wiki - IAKerb](https://k5wiki.kerberos.org/wiki/Projects/IAKERB#libkrb5)\n\n\n I've added these to the Kerberos ASN1 parsers.\n\nBefore:\n\n```\n> & 'C:\\Program Files\\Wireshark\\tshark.exe' -r .\\iakerb.pcapng -Y kerberos\n  183  28.682634 172.19.96.119 → 172.19.96.77 SMB2 452 Session Setup Request\n  184  28.693501 172.19.96.77 → 172.19.96.119 SMB2 308 KRB Error: Unknown error code 0x55\n```\n\nAfter:\n\n```\nwill@CPC-wiaft-EQ35Q ~/w/build (master)> ./run/tshark -r ~/iakerb.pcapng -Y \"kerberos\"\n  183  28.682634 172.19.96.119 → 172.19.96.77 SMB2 452 Session Setup Request\n  184  28.693501 172.19.96.77 → 172.19.96.119 SMB2 308 KRB Error: KRB_AP_ERR_IAKERB_KDC_NOT_FOUND\n```",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2025-07-15T19:57:38.443Z",
  "updated_at": "2025-07-16T14:57:04.969Z",
